*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
* I_B.SCB.STMP.DTY.EXEP.COMMON
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Modification History :
*
* <date> - <ADO ref> - <author> - Shared COMMON for the multi-threaded B.SCB.STMP.DTY.EXEP
*          batch: B.SCB.STMP.DTY.EXEP.LOAD resolves these once before threading starts,
*          B.SCB.STMP.DTY.EXEP (the worker) reuses them on every threaded call instead of
*          re-opening the file / re-resolving the local ref position per id.
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

    COMMON /B.SCB.STMP.DTY.EXEP.COMMON/ FN.SECURITY.MASTER, F.SECURITY.MASTER, Y.LWM.GSD.POS
